Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: drone and UAV security testing tools
 This metapackage installs tools for security testing and analysis of drone
 and UAV systems. It covers SDR and RF analysis of telemetry, control, and
 video links; Remote ID and DJI DroneID capture; MAVLink and DroneCAN
 telemetry; Meshtastic field links; GNSS; firmware and hardware analysis; and
 computer-vision support for optical detection.
 .
 The recommended dependencies include the SDR backends and Kismet capture
 helpers available in the archive. This provides support for a range of radio
 devices without requiring additional packages during field operation.
 .
 General password recovery, reverse engineering, forensics, and web security
 tools remain in their existing Parrot metapackages.
